: {"file_name": "green_beret_horizontal_2560x1440.png", "id": "28326744666978556", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_28326744670311889_1009133893118602925_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bNQrfjxxx7MQ7kNvwEgLndF&_nc_oc=Adp5uwkX1OpW-Cv0ZvGaMjwniMax0Iq50O1YkjTNUbCsc51s_jAR8cY5y2RpfZ5hXdo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK9MlE7db0PpDIeOuSTlI_u8k1JupDI4-WscjYPa23chA&oe=6AB52CD1"}, "display_name": "Green Beret", "keywords": ["shooter", "fps", "military", "action", "singleplayer"], "long_description": "You let yourself get captured. Now the real mission begins.\n\nA rebel army led by Colonel Walker has seized a remote island in the Pacific and turned an ancient fortress into its base of operations. Its underground dungeons are being used as prison cells, while heavily armed soldiers control the island.\n\nAs an elite Green Beret, getting captured was the only way inside.\n\nEscape from your cell, recover your weapons and fight your way through the fortress, its dungeons and the surrounding enemy positions. Eliminate the rebel forces, dismantle Colonel Walker's operation and find a way off the island alive.\n\nGreen Beret is a virtual reality first-person shooter inspired by classic action games and old-school military shooters.\n\n\u2022 Escape from an enemy prison\n\u2022 Fight your way through a heavily defended fortress\n\u2022 Face armed soldiers in intense VR firefights\n\u2022 Explore dungeons, military positions and enemy-controlled areas\n\u2022 Use different weapons to survive the mission\n\u2022 Experience classic FPS action rebuilt for virtual reality\n\nGet in. Complete the mission. Get out alive.", "short_description": "Infiltrate a rebel-held island, escape captivity and fight your way through a heavily defended fortress in this VR first-person shooter inspired by classic action games."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1098434826036106", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Green Beret", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Green Beret: Rebels Operation es un juego de disparos de\nrealidad virtual inspirado en los grandes shooters cl\u00e1sicos que\ntantas horas hemos disfrutado.\n\nAsume el papel de un boina verde infiltrado en una isla tomada\npor un grupo de soldados rebeldes.\n\nHistoria:\n\nUn grupo de soldados sublevados a las \u00f3rdenes del coronel \nWalker han tomado una rec\u00f3ndita isla situada en el oc\u00e9ano\nPac\u00edfico y han formado all\u00ed su centro de operaciones.\n\nEn la isla se encuentra un antiguo castillo que est\u00e1n usando\ncomo base de operaciones y usan sus mazmorras subterr\u00e1neas como\nceldas.\n\nLa \u00fanica forma de entrar en la isla es siendo capturado. En tu\nmisi\u00f3n, te has dejado capturar y has sido encerrado en una de\nlas celdas del castillo.\n\nTu siguiente misi\u00f3n es escapar de tu celda, aniquilar a todos\nlos enemigos para acabar con la organizaci\u00f3n y conseguir \nescapar de la isla.\n\n\u00bfEst\u00e1s preparado para MORIR?", "short_description": "Green Beret: Rebels Operation es un juego de disparos de\nrealidad virtual inspirado en los grandes shooters cl\u00e1sicos."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ippogames.com/PrivacyPolicy_palvesoft_mod.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "PalveSoft S.L.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ippogames.com/PrivacyPolicy_palvesoft_mod.html", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MO